    "before_you_ship": [
      "Verify the specific entries you deploy by calling them or checking the provider's own site.",
      "crisis_resources() returns a FLAT list. Do not paste this whole file into CRISIS_RESOURCES — a person in crisis should not be handed 170 countries to scan.",
      "Set CRISIS_RESOURCES to the two or three lines relevant to where your users actually are, and keep the universal entry."
    ],
    "why_a_universal_entry_matters": "findahelpline.com geolocates the visitor and is actively maintained, so it stays correct as numbers change and covers countries missing here. It is the safest single fallback.",
